# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different OS, they may break the lockfile.
#   Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Poetry; similar to pipenv, add poetry.lock to git ignore if you prefer.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock or poetry.lock, pdm.lock is ignored by default
